OL,3,GNEWSAPatch of one of UK's rarest
OL,4,Aflowers saved from falling into the sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservationists say thousands of rare
OL,7,Fflowers have been saved from falling
OL,8,Finto the sea on the Moray coast.
OL,10,FIn the UK, the one-flowered wintergreen
OL,11,Fcan only be found in pine woodlands in
OL,12,Fnorth-east Scotland.
OL,14,FMore than half the entire population of
OL,15,Fthe star-shaped flower have been lost
OL,16,Fover the last 50 years.
OL,18,FAbout 3,400 of the tiny plants have
OL,19,Fbeen rescued from an area of eroded
OL,20,Fbeach at Culbin Sands, an area of dunes
OL,21,Fand forest near Findhorn, and moved to
OL,22,Fa safe location nearby.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
